      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>CachingValueExpressionEvaluatorFactory</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/ExpressionParser.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>ExpressionParser</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/EnvironmentCapable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment provider</code></a> and <a href=\"../../spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a> with a specific\n<code>cacheSize</code>.",
